---
import Main from "@/layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/components/PageHeader.astro";
import TokenCard from "@/components/TokenCard.astro";
import FeatureCard from "@/components/FeatureCard.astro";
import MarketFlywheel from "@/components/MarketFlywheel.astro";
---

<Main
  title="Protocol - Sovereign InfraFi for Canadian energy and compute"
  description="A two-sided credit protocol: CADS synthetic dollar, sCADS staked yield, CROWN governance. Asset-backed by Canadian energy and compute. The Northern Queue redemption primitive."
  activePath="/protocol"
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Protocol"
    title="Sovereign InfraFi: a two-sided credit market backed by Canadian assets."
    lede="DAI Compute connects depositors who supply capital with builders who finance Canadian energy and compute. Loans are originated against physical assets and cashflows; positions are tokenised, transparent, and sovereign by law."
  />

  <!-- Instrument stack -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
    <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">The instrument stack</p>
    <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow">
      Three instruments, each with one job.
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <TokenCard
        symbol="CADS"
        name="Synthetic dollar"
        tagline="Fully-backed synthetic Canadian dollar. The stable entry point and unit of account."
        attributes={[
          { k: "Type", v: "Synthetic dollar" },
          { k: "Peg", v: "1:1 to CAD" },
          { k: "Yield", v: "None" },
        ]}
      />
      <TokenCard
        symbol="sCADS"
        name="Staked yield"
        tagline="Yield-bearing counterpart. Earns from the infrastructure loan book plus idle T-bills."
        accent="yellow"
        attributes={[
          { k: "Type", v: "Staked yield token" },
          { k: "Yield", v: "Loan interest + T-bills" },
          { k: "Redeem", v: "Northern Queue epochs" },
        ]}
      />
      <TokenCard
        symbol="CROWN"
        name="Governance"
        tagline="Governs collateral standards, LTV tiers, fees, and collateral-universe expansion."
        accent="red"
        attributes={[
          { k: "Type", v: "Governance token" },
          { k: "Staking", v: "sCROWN backstop" },
          { k: "Escrow", v: "veCROWN (considered)" },
        ]}
      />
    </div>
    <p class="field-note mt-6 text-slate/60">
      Token names (CADS, sCADS, CROWN, sCROWN) are candidates pending live trademark and ticker validation.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- The flywheel -->
  <section class="border-y border-hairline bg-ink-2/30">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
      <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">The two-sided market</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow">
        Capital funds loans. Loans build assets. Assets repay capital.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <MarketFlywheel />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Asset-backing / attestation layer -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">The backing layer</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow sm:text-3xl">
          Energy and compute, attested and collateralised.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate">
          Beneath the credit instruments sits an attestation layer. Smart-meter
          oracles prove that a financed asset generates verified Canadian
          renewable energy; proof-of-compute proves that a financed node
          provides verified Canadian compute capacity. These attestations
          determine loan eligibility, loan-to-value, and cashflow validation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate">
          Solar-powered compute is a renewable resource: carbon-aware compute,
          backed by real generation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">The redemption primitive</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow sm:text-3xl">
          The Northern Queue.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate">
          Because capital is deployed into illiquid, amortising infrastructure
          loans, sCADS redemptions run on fixed epochs. Depositors may bid,
          privately, for faster queue position; bids are redistributed to
          passive stakers. If no one bids, the queue defaults to first-in,
          first-out. The protocol never force-liquidates loans to satisfy
          withdrawals, which prevents disorderly exits and depeg spirals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Governance + regulatory -->
  <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-ink-2/30">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <FeatureCard kicker="Governance" title="CROWN and stewardship" accent="red">
          CROWN holders vote on the parameters that shape the protocol: which
          assets qualify as collateral, loan-to-value and interest-rate tiers,
          fees, and how the collateral universe expands. Staked CROWN (sCROWN)
          serves as a backstop in a shortfall event.
        </FeatureCard>
        <FeatureCard kicker="Regulatory" title="Built for Canadian law">
          CADS is designed as a fully-reserved payment instrument; the
          yield-bearing sCADS is structured for the CSA Sandbox; loans use SPV
          isolation and PPSA-perfected security. FINTRAC registration and
          provincial energy compliance are part of the pathway.
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>
      <p class="field-note mt-8 max-w-3xl text-slate/70">
        DAI Compute is pre-launch. No token has been issued and no financial
        product is offered. Nothing here is an offer to sell or a solicitation,
        or investment advice. Live figures will be published only after
        regulatory clarity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 text-center lg:px-10">
    <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-2xl font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow sm:text-3xl">
      A full technical whitepaper is in preparation.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate">
      Covering the instrument stack, the on-chain / off-chain interplay, the
      Northern Queue, tokenomics, and risk. Register to be notified.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8 inline-flex items-center px-7 py-3.5 text-sm">
      Request the whitepaper
    </a>
  </section>
</Main>
